==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{m|non|hvíla}}, akin to {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐍈𐌴𐌹𐌻𐌰𐌽||to pause, cease}}, from {{etyl|got|-}} {{m|got|𐍈𐌴𐌹𐌻𐌰||hour}}, akin to {{etyl|goh|-}} {{m|goh|hwila||a while}} (or {{m|goh|wila}} or {{m|goh|hwil}}), compare {{etyl|de|-}} {{m|de|Weile}}.

